WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.320
Speaker 1: Donald Trump has opened a 36&nbsp;
point lead over Ron DeSantis in a new poll.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:19.080
These are stunning numbers, 58 to 22. 58 to&nbsp;
22. Trump is leading DeSantis in a new poll,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:26.700
an even bigger lead than what we have seen&nbsp;
recently. CBS News YouGov poll of 2300 voters.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:33.180
I am continuing to tell you that&nbsp;
we can look at all aspects of this,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:41.040
but unless something seriously changes, unless&nbsp;
something really changes, I don't see a path&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:48.180
for anyone other than Trump to win that Republican&nbsp;
nomination, including DeSantis Desanctis, Dissent,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:56.700
pneumonias, whatever you want to call the guy. He&nbsp;
doesn't have a path to the 50% he needs unless he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.700 --> 00:01:05.400
can take support from Donald Trump. When you're at&nbsp;
58% as Trump is, you don't need any more voters.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:10.440
You've already got what you need. Now, of course,&nbsp;
if you only have it in certain states and not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:15.960
others and the timing of the primaries. There's&nbsp;
this these narrow, narrow, narrow scenarios. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:20.580
much like I was honest with you, in the 2020&nbsp;
Democratic primary, when I saw that it wasn't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:25.680
looking like Bernie had a path and many people&nbsp;
got mad at me. It's not looking mathematically&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:32.700
like DeSantis has a path unless something happens&nbsp;
with Trump, either. Some self-inflicted error,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:37.440
multiple arrests that take him off the campaign&nbsp;
trail, and definitely something like that. Trump&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:44.340
