the nomination without convincing a single&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:49.260
additional voter. So we will see where things&nbsp;
look in a month as we will be closer to when,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.260 --> 00:01:54.480
I guess the Sanders would be announcing if&nbsp;
he plans to. But as of right now, it's hard&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:58.920
